=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  accounts not-read-menu ---------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. User Management on that host: item 3$
# says the accounts can't be read, never "Nothing to review".$
$
# User Management ##############################################$
$
  [+] User                 Configured non-root, sudo$
$
  george -------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Sudo                 Enabled$
   -  Granted by           group sudo$
   -  SSH Keys             2 keys$
   -  Password             Set$
$
  alice --------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Sudo                 Disabled$
   -  SSH Keys             1 key$
   -  Password             Set$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Manage User          Configure sudo, SSH keys$
   2) Create User          Configure a new user$
   3) Account Review       Can't read the accounts$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-3 or q]:$
$
$

